## What it is

A sci-fi action game focused on agile combat, cooperative missions, and building your collection of equipment.

## Is this your kind of game?

Consider Warframe if you enjoy cooperative action alongside a longer progression system. Before installing, look at how missions and equipment progression fit together so you can decide whether that structure suits your play time.

## Download and purchase

The base game is listed as free to play; optional purchases may be available. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

The Steam listing identifies a Warframe account requirement. Check the current account-linking instructions on the official store.

## Before installing

Compare your operating system, processor, memory, graphics support, and available storage with the complete current requirements. A minimum specification is not a promise of a particular frame rate on your computer. Leave room for updates and check any additional account requirements before downloading.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/230410/?l=english) on 16 October 2026. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/). This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
